msgid "编写与构建文档"
msgstr "Writing and building documentation"

msgid "组织规则"
msgstr "Organization"

msgid ""
"现行手册只放在 Documentation/，使用 UTF-8 reStructuredText。 按读者任务组织 admin-"
"guide、applications、kbuild、userspace-api、process， 每个目录提供 index.rst 和显式 "
"toctree。保持段落可读，一页解决一个主题。 标题使用等号上下线，章用等号、节用横线、子节用波浪线；代码用字面块或 code-block。 "
"标题装饰线按显示宽度计算，汉字通常占两列；混排标题的上下线均须覆盖整行标题。 交叉引用使用 doc/ref "
"角色，避免绝对宿主路径、陈旧构建编号和失效截图链接。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the current manuals in Documentation/, using UTF-8 reStructuredText. "
"Organize admin-guide, applications, kbuild, userspace-api and process around"
" reader tasks, with an index.rst and explicit toctree in each directory. "
"Keep paragraphs readable and cover one topic per page. Surround document "
"titles with equals signs; use equals signs for chapters, hyphens for "
"sections and tildes for subsections. Use literal blocks or code-block for "
"code. Size heading adornments by display width: Chinese characters usually "
"occupy two columns, and both adornment lines must span the entire mixed-"
"language title. Use doc/ref roles for cross-references; avoid absolute host "
"paths, obsolete build numbers and broken screenshot links."

msgid ""
"先写目的、前提与可操作步骤，再写接口约束、错误和限制。不把计划、聊天交接、 日志流水账或审查回合当使用手册。历史事实由 Git 与已发布 Release"
" 保存。 AGENT、许可证、上游说明和机器输入按其职责保留，不批量转换。 ReliefNT 的内核手册只在 ReliefNT "
"仓库维护；主仓手册记录用户态与系统集成。 完整 Pages/RPR 网站从两仓读取文档，发布到独立入口，见 "
":doc:`../kbuild/products`。"
msgstr ""
"Start with purpose, prerequisites and actionable steps, then describe "
"interface contracts, errors and limitations. Do not turn plans, chat "
"handoffs, chronological logs or review rounds into manuals. Git and "
"published Releases preserve historical facts. Keep AGENT, licenses, upstream"
" documentation and machine inputs in their respective roles rather than "
"converting them in bulk. Maintain the ReliefNT kernel manual only in the "
"ReliefNT repository; the parent manual covers userspace and system "
"integration. The complete Pages/RPR site reads both repositories and "
"publishes separate entry points; see :doc:`../kbuild/products`."

msgid ""
"格式依据 `Linux 文档指南 <https://docs.kernel.org/doc-guide/sphinx.html>`_， "
"只采用适合本项目的 Sphinx/RST 组织，不声称继承 Linux 的全部专用扩展。"
msgstr ""
"Follow the format of the `Linux documentation guide "
"<https://docs.kernel.org/doc-guide/sphinx.html>`_, using only the Sphinx/RST"
" conventions appropriate for this project; this does not imply support for "
"all Linux-specific extensions."

msgid "构建与检查"
msgstr "Building and checking"

msgid ""
"宿主安装 Sphinx 5.3 至 9.x（依赖范围在 Documentation/requirements.txt）。 "
"无需交叉编译工具链或配置产品即可构建::"
msgstr ""
"Install Sphinx 5.3 through 9.x on the host (the dependency range is in "
"Documentation/requirements.txt). No cross toolchain or product configuration"
" is needed to build::"

msgid ""
"输出分别在所选 O/Documentation/html/。默认采用 Alabaster 导航；页面可离线 阅读并放在任意 URL 前缀下，不加载 "
"JavaScript，不提供依赖 JS 的搜索框。 简体中文是源语言及默认入口，英文位于 en/，日文位于 ja/；各页的语言导航 "
"切换到另一语言的同名页面。网站文档中心同样提供中文、英文和日文入口， 两套手册的链接保持所选语言。既有中文页面地址保持不变。 构建启用 nitpicky"
" 和 warnings-as-errors；缺失交叉引用、未收入目录、错误语法 均须修复，不能通过关闭警告或排除现行页面让检查变绿。 文档生成所需 "
"Python/Sphinx 仅属于文档工具，不进入目标系统编译链。"
msgstr ""
"Each manual is written to the selected O/Documentation/html/. Navigation "
"uses Alabaster by default. Pages work offline and under any URL prefix, load"
" no JavaScript and provide no JavaScript-dependent search box. Simplified "
"Chinese is the source language and default entry point; English is under en/"
" and Japanese under ja/. Each page has language links to the same page in "
"the other languages. The documentation portal also has Chinese, English and "
"Japanese entry points, and links to both manuals preserve the selected "
"language. Existing Chinese page URLs remain unchanged. Builds enable "
"nitpicky mode and treat warnings as errors: fix missing cross-references, "
"pages omitted from the contents and syntax errors rather than disabling "
"warnings or excluding current pages. Python/Sphinx are documentation tools "
"and do not enter the target-system compilation chain."

msgid "翻译维护"
msgstr "Maintaining translations"

msgid ""
"只修改中文 RST 源文档。英文与日文使用 gettext PO，按完整文档路径保存为 "
"``Documentation/locale/{en,ja}/LC_MESSAGES/<docname>.po``，例如 "
"``Documentation/locale/en/LC_MESSAGES/process/documentation.po``。 "
"``gettext_compact = False`` 保证每页独立生成目录，不合并同章消息。 HTML 构建先将 locale "
"复制到临时输出中再编译，MO 不写回源码目录。"
msgstr ""
"Edit the Chinese RST source documents. English and Japanese translations use"
" gettext PO files at the full document path, "
"``Documentation/locale/{en,ja}/LC_MESSAGES/<docname>.po``, for example "
"``Documentation/locale/en/LC_MESSAGES/process/documentation.po``. "
"``gettext_compact = False`` creates a separate catalog for each page rather "
"than merging messages by chapter. HTML builds copy locale into temporary "
"output before compiling it; MO files are never written into the source tree."

msgid "两仓均提供独立的提取和检查目标，无需编译产品::"
msgstr ""
"Both repositories provide independent extraction and checking targets that "
"do not compile products::"

msgid ""
"POT 输出到所选 ``O/Documentation/gettext/``，每次提取替换旧模板，避免遗留 已删除页面。维护脚本使用 Sphinx 的 "
"Babel 依赖，不需要另装翻译工具。 也可在各自仓库直接运行::"
msgstr ""
"POT files are written to the selected ``O/Documentation/gettext/``. Each "
"extraction replaces the old templates so deleted pages leave no stale "
"templates. The maintenance script uses the Babel dependency supplied with "
"Sphinx, requiring no additional translation tools. You can also run it "
"directly in each repository::"

msgid ""
"默认只提取 POT；显式 ``--update`` 才会初始化或合并英文、日文 PO，保留现有 译文与译者注释，可能的近似匹配标记为 "
"fuzzy，必须人工复核。 ``--check`` 按当前源码重新提取模板，只读检查全部 PO；缺页、缺消息、空译文、 "
"fuzzy、过期消息和含中文原文整段照抄均导致失败，不将中文回退视为翻译完成。 纯英文命令和路径允许与原文相同。需要保留原文的中文技术词或日文同形词， "
"在本仓 ``Documentation/locale/identical.json`` 按语言登记完整 msgid，例如::"
msgstr ""
"The default operation only extracts POT files. Only an explicit ``--update``"
" initializes or merges English and Japanese PO files, preserving existing "
"translations and translator comments. Potential approximate matches are "
"marked fuzzy and require human review. ``--check`` extracts templates from "
"the current source and checks every PO file without modifying it. Missing "
"pages or messages, empty translations, fuzzy entries, obsolete messages and "
"entire passages copied unchanged from Chinese all fail the check; Chinese "
"fallback does not count as a completed translation. Plain English commands "
"and paths may match the source. For Chinese technical terms or Japanese "
"terms written identically to the source that must remain unchanged, register"
" the full msgid for the appropriate language in this repository's "
"``Documentation/locale/identical.json``, for example::"

msgid ""
"白名单必须恰好包含 ``en``、``ja`` 两个键，值为不重复的非空字符串数组。 按完整 msgid "
"精确匹配，不支持模糊匹配或通配；日文例外不用于英文。 ``gettext-check`` 与 ``htmldocs`` "
"预检默认读取同一文件，删除例外后同形译文 会再次检查失败。``--allow-identical '术语'`` 仅为本次 CLI 检查临时添加两种语言 "
"共用的例外，不修改持久白名单。行号与提取时间变化不算译文过期。"
msgstr ""
"The allowlist must contain exactly the keys ``en`` and ``ja``, each with an "
"array of unique, nonempty strings. It matches complete msgids exactly, with "
"no fuzzy matches or wildcards; Japanese exceptions do not apply to English. "
"``gettext-check`` and the ``htmldocs`` preflight read the same file by "
"default. Removing an exception makes the unchanged translation fail again. "
"``--allow-identical '术语'`` adds an exception shared by both languages only "
"for the current CLI check and does not modify the persistent allowlist. "
"Changes to line numbers and extraction times do not make a translation "
"stale."

msgid ""
"``htmldocs``、``gettext``、``gettext-check`` 通过 ``scripts/docs-python.sh`` "
"共用解释器选择：显式非空 ``DOCS_PYTHON`` 优先，否则依次选择 ``SPHINXBUILD`` 所在目录的 "
"``python``、``python3``，均不存在时才使用 PATH 中的 ``python3``。 只设置 "
"``SPHINXBUILD=/path/to/venv/bin/sphinx-build`` 即可使用该虚拟环境的 Babel；可用 "
"``DOCS_PYTHON=/path/to/python`` 显式覆盖。直接运行 Python 维护 脚本时，仍需激活相同环境或显式选择该环境的 "
"Python。"
msgstr ""
"``htmldocs``, ``gettext`` and ``gettext-check`` share interpreter selection "
"through ``scripts/docs-python.sh``. An explicitly nonempty ``DOCS_PYTHON`` "
"takes precedence. Otherwise the script tries ``python`` and then ``python3``"
" in the directory containing ``SPHINXBUILD``, using ``python3`` from PATH "
"only if neither exists. Setting only ``SPHINXBUILD=/path/to/venv/bin/sphinx-"
"build`` is enough to use that virtual environment's Babel. Use "
"``DOCS_PYTHON=/path/to/python`` for an explicit override. When running the "
"Python maintenance script directly, activate the same environment or "
"explicitly select its Python."

msgid "完整文档检查无需编译内核或应用，但须初始化所选 ReliefNT 子模块::"
msgstr ""
"The complete documentation check requires no kernel or application "
"compilation, but the selected ReliefNT submodule must be initialized::"

msgid ""
"此检查通过两仓的 ``make htmldocs`` 入口和实际 Pages 文档入口构建全部页面， 核对每个 RST 页面、站内链接、HTML "
"锚点和资源，拒绝依赖网站根路径的链接、 JavaScript 及源文档泄漏。只检查现有文档入口可传 ``--site 路径``。 "
"外部网站链接不在此离线检查范围内。"
msgstr ""
"This check builds every page through both repositories' ``make htmldocs`` "
"targets and the actual Pages documentation entry point. It checks every RST "
"page, internal link, HTML anchor and asset, and rejects links tied to the "
"website root, JavaScript and leaked document sources. Use ``--site path`` to"
" check an existing documentation portal. External websites are outside the "
"scope of this offline check."

msgid ""
"``Check documentation`` 工作流在推送和 PR 时独立检查文档，覆盖 Sphinx 5.3、 Pages 当前使用的 7.2.6 "
"和 9.x，并检查两套手册的完整翻译。Pages 发布工作流也会先运行文档检查，再构建 系统镜像；两处均保留严格警告检查，不以关闭警告绕过失败。"
msgstr ""
"The ``Check documentation`` workflow checks documentation independently on "
"pushes and PRs, covering Sphinx 5.3, the Pages version 7.2.6 and 9.x, and "
"checks complete translations of both manuals. The Pages publishing workflow "
"also checks documentation before building system images. Both retain strict "
"warning checks; disabling warnings is not a way to bypass failures."
